  "description": "The Murderer of Pflatzgraff Manor is a brand-new horror game from the developer A-coms. Even though it has beautiful graphics, its player base dubbed it as one of the worst games due to how difficult it is. You play the game as Adrian—a fine young man who’s also the devil’s reincarnation. Your goal as Adrian is to kill as many people as possible because of Lilith’s Curse. One night, you played the game until you couldn’t anymore and found yourself waking up as Hilda, one of Adrian’s maids… \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
